  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Complex Crisis 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 15 April 2023, clashes broke out in the capital city of Khartoum, between rival factions of the country&apos;s ruling military. The clashes began when the paramilitary Rapid Support Forces launched attacks on key government sites. Explosions and gunfire were reported across Khartoum. Gunfire exchanges between the Sudanese army and the paramilitary Rapid Support Forces (RSF) then started to spread across the country.</narrative>
  </description>
